compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8441048Z Description-en: distributed, interactive, smart revision control system
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8441356Z  Darcs is a free, open source revision control system.  It is:
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8441580Z  .
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8441771Z   * Distributed: Every user has access to the full command set,
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8442060Z     removing boundaries between server and client or committer and
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8442286Z     non-committers.
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8442509Z   * Interactive: Darcs is easy to learn and efficient to use because
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8442792Z     it asks you questions in response to simple commands, giving you
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8443081Z     choices in your work flow. You can choose to record one change in
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8443367Z     a file, while ignoring another. As you update from upstream, you
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8443650Z     can review each patch name, even the full "diff" for interesting
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8443870Z     patches.
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8444068Z   * Smart: Originally developed by physicist David Roundy, darcs is
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8444478Z     based on a unique algebra of patches. This smartness lets you
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8444756Z     respond to changing demands in ways that would otherwise not be
compile-cljs	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-03T15:01:54.8444973Z     possible.
